sequenceDiagram
    participant U as 사용자
    participant CH as challenges.js
    participant FS as Firestore
    participant MS as matchStats.js
    participant AI as aiCoach.js
    participant CF as Cloud Functions
    participant GM as Gemini

    U->>CH: submitResult (승자, 스코어)
    alt 관리자 결과 수정
        CH->>CH: _updateMatchPoints(winner, sign=-1)
        CH->>FS: updateDoc members (포인트 복원)
    end
    CH->>FS: updateDoc challenge (status=completed)
    CH->>CH: _updateMatchPoints(winner, sign=+1)
    loop 각 승/패 선수
        CH->>FS: updateDoc members (individualPoint/doublePoint)
    end
    FS-->>CH: onSnapshot → 전 탭 재렌더

    CH->>MS: 전적·포인트 delta 계산
    CH->>AI: _buildPostMatchCoachComment()
    alt localStorage 캐시 hit
        AI-->>CH: cached comment
    else 캐시 miss
        AI->>CF: POST postMatchComment
        CF->>GM: generateContent
        GM-->>CF: JSON text
        CF-->>AI: { ok, comment }
        AI->>AI: savePostMatchCache
    end
    CH->>U: showResultFeedback (토스트 + AI 코멘트)
